= The New Beginning

Perhaps, you expected something grand or at least funny. Let me present my world to your eyes.

I was Noske, social fascist. I told them that communists are more of threat than the actual nationalists are.

Now, looking at my creation, I could tell you something: By the end of it, you will find out something rather dissapointing: The feeling of betrayal. The only one you can blame is.

Regardless, horizon has all different meanings to it and depending on how you see it, you will find the different angles of the truth. As for me, I betrayed the ideals of socialism for slim chance of liberation. Perhaps, I would love to work with state socialists and paternalists like true social democrat.

Or perhaps, I could smile and laugh at the illusions. At the illusion of collectivist society and their feelings.

[? if gillart_98: I stand upon the hell of today's, there is nothing more disgusting than our biology of homo sapience, our nature. Perhaps, all of us are meant to be stuck in servant - owner relations.  All our faults and failures come from our best judgment, which means our potential as highest piece of food chain is still not achieved, not even measly 5% of it. And as long as we remain as such, machines will surpass at every occasion and distance between us will grow at geometrical progression, giving us no mercy but irrelevancy's slavery, being stuck in unemployedness with no guarantee of UBI. Open your eyes before your weakness before your weakness will consume your soul and your meaning, before they will divide you and your meaning into purposes and goals to exploit upon.  You will rot as long current situation as normal, as status quo that is most comfortable with you. Stand with me, half of this world is no longer considered "homo sapience" in usual meaning of the word. Who knows, maybe robots will finally replace us and our conception of "super-human" and develop their own civilization, leaving our legacy in shambles. Your thinking is shallow so long your concerns are no higher than immigration, welfare, economy and global crisis matters are. Thriller. Face yourself - so long you are acceptant of the overreach of power at the current state of it, you will tolerate any hell - capitalist, hitlerist, socialist or even anarchist kind - it's overreaching hand of power and abuse will stretch so far so long human being accepts power, accepts hierarchy, will remain at their stereotypes, let them control their narrative, let **Iron Law of Oligarchy** be proven once again and again, as long as you accept it as "Lesser Evil". There is no lesser evil when it comes down to question of evil consolidating power and taking momentum of history. Social democracies of west are mere servants of the capitalist regime, social democracies of East and third world are mere populist weapons to boost artificial popularity dven further as the welfare chains them to their corruption - because the other side is welfare dismantling neoliberal... If it was up to me, "For money is the root of all evil" is their attempt to lie to themselves: it would be "For power is the root of all evil". As I open my curtains, all I see is byproducts of the human civilization and perhaps, my death. ?]     

[? if gillart_98: Now, tell me: Is your goal total transformation (with pretty much guarantee that others will just form system that will serve them, elites, once again...) or to feed your stomach and, if your altruism wills, of others? Don't lie to yourself, this is the rhetorical question regarding human nature, you are not here to decide it.?]

Now, I won't take your time...

